        "content": "Here are all five wallpapers for your 70\" TV — each at 2560x1440 (16:9) with ornate frames built in. They'll look like framed artwork hanging on a black wall when displayed:\n\n1. **Skull Cabinet (Framed)** — Your four carved skulls in a row, now encased in a lavish gold baroque frame against pure black.\n\n2. **Dark Botanical Cabinet** — A Victorian specimen case with death's-head moths, iridescent beetles, pressed ferns, and black roses lit by candlelight.\n\n3. **Apothecary Curiosity Shelf** — A raven, skull with candle, amethyst crystals, old books, brass instruments, and mysterious jars on dark shelves.\n\n4. **Gothic Gallery Wall** — Three paintings (moonlit stormy sea, foggy forest path, vanitas still life) on deep burgundy velvet with candle sconces between them.\n\n5. **Memento Mori Still Life** — A classical Dutch Golden Age composition with skull, hourglass, burning candle, pocket watch, wilting flowers, and quill pen.\n\nAll share the same dark, warm, moody aesthetic so they'd work great as a rotating set. Let me know if you'd like variations on any of these or different frame styles!"
      },
